# PC card pc-team-pack4 (BENCH-279): the pilot, p4 on the four teams, 8 seeds from 45000, 12 rounds, against master (the aa build). Template: the card's prep writes the work copy with @V@ = the robot.release in hadur-robot/pom.xml.
--team
true
--seeds
8
--seed-base
45000
--rounds
12
--parallel
auto
--child-heap
2G
--cpu-constant
auto
--set
plans/team-pack4-set.txt
--robot-jar
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@p4.jar
--robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@p4
--member
hadur117.Hadur
--out
work/team-pack4-@V@-pep
--report
../docs/bench/local/team-pack4-pep.md
--baseline
bisect/hadur117.HadurTeam_@V@aa.jar
--baseline-robot
hadur117.HadurTeam @V@aa
